nd="02:01.783">become </span><span begin="02:01.783" end="02:05.639">blue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.232" end="02:11.319"><span begin="02:07.232" end="02:07.591">It's </span><span begin="02:07.591" end="02:08.071">become </span><span begin="02:08.071" end="02:11.319">blue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.135" end="02:16.783"><span begin="02:14.135" end="02:14.327">We've </span><span begin="02:14.327" end="02:14.751">become </span><span begin="02:14.751" end="02:16.783">blue</span></p></div></body></tt>